# PyInstaller
#  Usually these files are written by a python script from a template
#  before PyInstaller builds the exe, so as a result the following patterns
#  will match the final binaries generated by PyInstaller too.
#  If that's useful for you, just uncomment one or more of the following lines
# (in most cases you won't need to uncomment anything):
# *.exe
# *.dll
# *.so

